✨ Features

🔐 Fingerprint Authentication
Secure voter authentication using a fingerprint sensor.

🎤 Voice Guidance
Provides voice-based instructions throughout the voting process.

📺 LCD Display
Displays system messages, instructions, and voting status.

🗳️ Vote Recording
Records the candidate selected by the authorized voter.

🔔 Buzzer Notification
Provides audio feedback for important system actions.

📊 Vote Counting
Keeps track of the votes recorded for each candidate.

🔒 One Person, One Vote
Prevents an authorized voter from voting more than once.

